## Why This Is Asked
Tests multi-tenant governance, cost-aware routing, hot-updatable policies, data locality, drift detection, and rollback in production.

## Key Concepts
- Cost-aware routing across model fleet
- Per-tenant budgets and SLOs
- Canary rollouts and rollback
- Versioned policy store with hot updates
- Data locality, isolation, observability

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo routing score
function score(model, tenant) {
  const cost = model.price * tenant.maxBudgetFactor;
  const latency = model.latencyMs <= tenant.latencySLO ? 0 : 1;
  const capability = model.capabilityScore;
  return wCost*cost + wLat*latency + wCap* (1 - capability);
}
```

